  "body_html": "<p>Experimenting with tones and stripes from Josef Albert's book “Interaction of Color”. </p>\n\n<p>The first 7 colors are from the book, the rest follows it's pattern, just with different hues.</p>\n\n<p>I've included some controls, allowing you to rotate the pattern, and change the width of the first color in each ”group”.</p>\n\n<p><iframe height=\"600\" src=\"https://codepen.io/stoumann/embed/WNRmWex?height=600&amp;default-tab=result&amp;embed-version=2\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allowtransparency=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n</iframe>\n</p>\n\n",
